menu "tinylink core"

    config TINYLINK_APP_TASK_WDT
        bool "Subscribe application tasks to the task watchdog"
        default y
        help
            wg_rx, wg_tx, telemetry, the DERP supervisor and the map
            long-poll subscribe to the ESP task WDT and feed it once per
            loop iteration (blocking TLS reads feed through the tls_io
            poll hook). With CONFIG_ESP_TASK_WDT_PANIC=y a task that
            stops iterating for CONFIG_ESP_TASK_WDT_TIMEOUT_S reboots
            the device into the known-good boot path. Disable for bench
            debugging with a debugger attached (breakpoints would trip
            it).

    config TINYLINK_BENCH_AEAD
        bool "Run ChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD micro-benchmark on boot"
        default n
        help
            When y, bringup() calls tinylink_bench_aead() once after
            tinylink_init() and before register, printing µs/call,
            MB/s and ns/byte for 64B and 1500B payloads. Used as the
            baseline against which crypto micro-optimizations are
            measured. Off by default; opt-in for perf work.

endmenu
